{
    "title": "Cats' Melody Run",
    "description": "Embark on a magical journey to restore the Meowsical Kingdom in this captivating rhythm game! The once-thriving land has been swallowed up by darkness. The Void has destroyed cities and scattered the musical cats, leaving the kingdom in despair.\r\nAs the chosen one, it's up to you to gather the lost Meowsicians and help them rediscover their magical musical powers. \r\nWith adorable characters, enchanting music, and a heartwarming story, Meowsicians will take you on a melody adventure you won't forget!\r\n\r\n\u3010ENGAGING MUSICAL GAMEPLAY\u3011                         \r\n- \ud83c\udfb5Hop and rush your Meowsicians between tiles and to the beat of diverse music genres.\r\n- \ud83c\udf1fFace diverse obstacles and tile patterns as you level up and strengthen your Meowsicians' Energy\r\n- \ud83c\udfb9Enjoy a mix of Pop, Rock, Indie, EDM, and more!\r\n\r\n**Better Experience with Headphones**\r\n\r\n\u3010CUTE COLLECTIBLES\u3011\r\n- \ud83d\udc31Unlock adorable Meowsicians and fun headwears.\r\n- \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fExplore beautiful game scenes and enjoy charming visuals.\r\n- \ud83c\udfdc\ufe0fRebuild lovely islands and discover their stories.\r\n\r\nIf any producer or label has concerns regarding the music or images used in our game, please contact us immediately, and we'll address any issues promptly.\r\n\r\nContact us:\r\nFor any questions or feedback, please reach out to us: @orcat.sg\r\n\r\nPRIVACY POLICY:\r\nhttps://catisland.s3.amazonaws.com/Resource/Privacy+Policy.html\r\n\r\nTERMS OF SERVICE:\r\nhttps://catisland.s3.amazonaws.com/Resource/Terms+of+Use.html\r\n\r\nHope you enjoy our game!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Embark on a magical journey to restore the Meowsical Kingdom in this captivating rhythm game! The once-thriving land has been swallowed up by darkness. The Void has destroyed cities and scattered the musical cats, leaving the kingdom in despair.<br>As the chosen one, it&#39;s up to you to gather the lost Meowsicians and help them rediscover their magical musical powers. <br>With adorable characters, enchanting music, and a heartwarming story, Meowsicians will take you on a melody adventure you won&#39;t forget!<br><br>\u3010ENGAGING MUSICAL GAMEPLAY\u3011                         <br>- \ud83c\udfb5Hop and rush your Meowsicians between tiles and to the beat of diverse music genres.<br>- \ud83c\udf1fFace diverse obstacles and tile patterns as you level up and strengthen your Meowsicians&#39; Energy<br>- \ud83c\udfb9Enjoy a mix of Pop, Rock, Indie, EDM, and more!<br><br>**Better Experience with Headphones**<br><br>\u3010CUTE COLLECTIBLES\u3011<br>- \ud83d\udc31Unlock adorable Meowsicians and fun headwears.<br>- \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0fExplore beautiful game scenes and enjoy charming visuals.<br>- \ud83c\udfdc\ufe0fRebuild lovely islands and discover their stories.<br><br>If any producer or label has concerns regarding the music or images used in our game, please contact us immediately, and we&#39;ll address any issues promptly.<br><br>Contact us:<br>For any questions or feedback, please reach out to us: @orcat.sg<br><br>PRIVACY POLICY:<br>https://catisland.s3.amazonaws.com/Resource/Privacy+Policy.html<br><br>TERMS OF SERVICE:<br>https://catisland.s3.amazonaws.com/Resource/Terms+of+Use.html<br><br>Hope you enjoy our game!",
